      "text": "Example: D=2.  x² - 2y² = 1.\n  Fundamental: (x₁,y₁) = (3,2). Check: 9 - 8 = 1 ✓\n  (3+2√2)² = 17+12√2 → (17,12). Check: 289 - 288 = 1 ✓\n  (3+2√2)³ = 99+70√2 → (99,70). Check: 9801 - 9800 = 1 ✓\n```"
