      "text": "Example: √2 = [1; 2, 2, 2, ...]\n  Convergents: 1/1, 3/2, 7/5, 17/12, ...\n  Period = 1 (a₁ = 2). Fundamental solution: p₀/q₀ = 1/1? No. p₁/q₁ = 3/2. ✓\n  x₁=3, y₁=2: 3² - 2·2² = 9-8=1 ✓"
